   "intro": "Probe run: `ui-consideration-probe.cjs` over **10 elements** (E1 selection action bar, E2 Send-to dialog, E3 collision dialog, E4 destructive confirmation dialog, E5 docked tray, E6 job row, E7 `/jobs` Active, E8 `/jobs` History, E9 `/audit` page, E10 auto-retry-paused guard note).\n\n**Coverage: 78 applicable → 57 covered · 6 backstop · 15 dismissed (reasoned) · 0 unresolved.**\n\n*Kind-confirmation (propose-then-confirm).* Detected kinds spanned `form`/`list-collection`/`nav`/`interactive-control`/`static-content` across E1–E9 and `media`/`interactive-control`/`static-content` for E10 — 78 of a possible 80 category-slots raised, so **recall is effectively maximal and no kind was missed**; no `elements` override was needed. The only narrowing is E10, correctly excluded from `partial`/`zero-one-many` (a single static note is not a collection). E1's `form` and E10's `media` are heuristic false positives — harmless, and dismissed with reasons below rather than suppressed.\n\nThree considerations were **not** answerable from `04-CONTEXT.md` and were resolved with the user this session — marked **P-01/P-02/P-03** below and written into `## Copywriting Contract`:\n- **P-01 (loading):** Skeleton rows matching the real row shape, reusing Phase 3's convention. No spinner.\n- **P-02 (error):** Inline `Alert` + verbatim backend reason + `Retry`, scoped to the failed section. Per D-15, a degraded/unreachable tier stays **selectable** in the Send-to picker — the attempt is the source of truth, the health dot is a hint.\n- **P-03 (cancelled/partial):** A cancelled job states that partly-copied files were **left** at the destination. The portal never deletes what it did not confirm; re-running resolves leftovers through the ordinary collision dialog.",
